---
// Hero principal — titular + brújula animada + card destacada
---

<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="wrap hero-inner">
    <div>
      <div class="hero-tag">
        <span class="dot"></span>
        33.ª Feria de Software USM · 13 de noviembre
      </div>
      <h1>
        Simulamos el tráfico<br />
        antes de <em>moverlo</em> de verdad.
      </h1>
      <p>
        Un gemelo digital del acceso a San Antonio, entrenado con redes neuronales de
        grafos y aprendizaje por refuerzo, para probar políticas de semaforización
        sin arriesgar una sola maniobra en terreno.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <button class="btn-primary" type="button">Ver la simulación</button>
        <a href="#como-funciona" class="btn-ghost">Cómo funciona</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-visual">
      <svg class="compass-big" viewBox="0 0 200 200" aria-hidden="true">
        <circle
          cx="100"
          cy="100"
          r="94"
          fill="none"
          stroke="rgba(255,248,234,0.25)"
          stroke-width="1.5"
        />
        <circle
          cx="100"
          cy="100"
          r="70"
          fill="none"
          stroke="rgba(255,248,234,0.18)"
          stroke-width="1"
        />
        <path d="M100 16 L112 100 L100 184 L88 100 Z" fill="#FFF8EA" />
        <path d="M16 100 L100 88 L184 100 L100 112 Z" fill="#61E1E6" />
      </svg>
      <div class="hero-card">
        <div class="big-num">9h → 2h</div>
        <div>Espera estimada en horas peak con políticas optimizadas por IA.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    background: var(--navy);
    color: var(--cream);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 100px 0 120px;
  }
  .hero-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }
  .hero-tag {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--cyan);
    border: 1px solid rgba(97, 225, 230, 0.4);
    border-radius: 100px;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .hero-tag .dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--lime);
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 56px;
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    max-width: 560px;
  }
  h1 em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--cyan);
  }
  p {
    margin-top: 24px;
    font-size: 17px;
    color: rgba(255, 248, 234, 0.78);
    max-width: 460px;
  }
  .hero-ctas {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 36px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--lime);
    color: var(--navy-deep);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
    padding: 15px 28px;
    border-radius: 100px;
  }
  .btn-ghost {
    color: var(--cream);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 15px;
    padding: 15px 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 248, 234, 0.4);
  }
  .hero-visual {
    position: relative;
    height: 420px;
  }
  .compass-big {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: 420px;
    height: 420px;
    opacity: 0.9;
    animation: spin 60s linear infinite;
  }
  @keyframes spin {
    from {
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(0deg);
    }
    to {
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(360deg);
    }
  }
  .hero-card {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    right: 0;
    background: rgba(255, 248, 234, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 248, 234, 0.16);
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 22px 24px;
    width: 260px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--cream);
  }
  .hero-card .big-num {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 34px;
    color: var(--lime);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .hero-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 38px;
    }
    .hero-visual {
      height: 260px;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }
    .compass-big {
      width: 220px;
      height: 220px;
    }
  }
</style>
